'' A UDT AS poke's VALUE AND AS bit/bitset/bitreset's BIT NUMBER runs its numeric cast. tiko
'' lowered the object and emitted a hole. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/udt-numarg4.bas -o tests/codegen/udtnumarg4.exe
